<title>AUSTRALIA: PAST RATE CUTS MADE A$ MORE COMPETITIVE-FISCHER.</title>
<headline>PAST RATE CUTS MADE A$ MORE COMPETITIVE-FISCHER.</headline>
<dateline>CANBERRA 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian Acting Prime Minister Tim Fischer said on Thursday past reductions in official cash interest rates had made the Australian dollar more competitive and helped exporters.</p>
</text>
